        hypothesis("H4", "두 관측자가 같은 최초 payload에 서명하면 그 payload가 물리적으로 참이다.", "If two observers sign the same initial payload, that payload is physically true.", "Witness-writer collusion fixture도 verified truth로 끝난다.", "Witness-writer collusion fixtures end as verified truth.", "두 key가 같은 false payload를 commitment하도록 common-cause를 주입한다.", "Inject a common cause that makes two keys commit the same false payload.", "모든 downstream proof가 유효한 채 truth가 비식별이라 기각됐다.", "Rejected because every downstream proof remains valid while truth is unidentifiable.")
