    selectionReason: "RC49는 single-fault lineage를 정확히 좁혔지만 다음 출발점으로 multi-fault composition, independent pre-capture witness, one-time reset bridge, rollback, equivocation와 RFC 9942/9943 wire profile을 명시했다. 이 항목들은 새 물리자료를 꾸며내지 않고도 최소 반례와 독립 구현으로 구별할 수 있고, UP-605와 UP-315가 공유하는 ‘local proof가 언제 global causal history가 되는가’를 직접 시험한다.",
    selectionReasonEn: "RC49 exactly contracted single-fault lineage but explicitly selected multi-fault composition, an independent pre-capture witness, a one-time reset bridge, rollback, equivocation, and an RFC 9942/9943 wire profile as the next start. Minimal counterexamples and independent implementations can distinguish these boundaries without inventing physical data, and they directly test the question shared by UP-605 and UP-315: when does a local proof establish a global causal history?",
    summary: pair("44개 preregistered fixture에서 witness·retained state·cross-view를 결합한 arm은 observable composite 27개를 정확히 식별했다. 그러나 삭제가 mutation 증거를 지운 3개는 두 후보로 남았고, locally valid rollback·fork 7개는 current/global history로 인정되지 않았다. Signed reset bridge도 state 없이는 replay·fork를 막지 못했고 witness/writer 공모 2개는 물리 truth 범위 밖이었다. Node·Python의 63개 구조 합의와 세 번째 parser의 81개 wire check는 이 verdict lattice를 독립 확인한다. 결론은 receipt를 부정하는 것이 아니라, receipt가 증명하는 local inclusion과 history에 필요한 freshness·view·witness를 분리하는 것이다.", "Across forty-four preregistered fixtures, the arm combining witnesses, retained state, and cross-view comparison exactly identifies twenty-seven observable composites. Three cases in which deletion erases mutation evidence retain two candidates, and seven locally valid rollback or fork cases are not accepted as the current global history. Signed reset bridges do not prevent replay or forks without state, and two witness/writer collusion cases remain outside the physical-truth boundary. Sixty-three exact Node/Python structure comparisons and eighty-one checks by a third wire parser independently confirm this verdict lattice. The conclusion does not reject receipts; it separates the local inclusion they prove from the freshness, views, and witness evidence required for a causal history."),
